@overheard goodbyes
// Writer 5, for social B2: crew-to-crew goodbyes on rotation days. Speaker A is the one leaving (leaving:soon, a day
// or two before); B is their friend, best friend, mentor or partner. Warm, a little wistful, light. Couple talk only
// under pair:couple. Named ones are for the current leavers and their canon closest.

== overheard
? pair:friend leaving:soon
A: Ten days went fast.
B: They always do when it's the last ten.
A: Save me a seat anyway.   #warm

? pair:friend leaving:soon
A: You'll write?
B: Every week. Badly.
A: Badly's fine. Just write.   #warm

? pair:friend leaving:soon time:evening
A: Last dinner in the mess, nearly.
B: Have pudding twice. It's the law.   #funny

? pair:best leaving:soon
A: Who's going to steal my toast?
B: I'll post you some. Cold.
A: Perfect. Just how I like it.   #funny

? pair:best leaving:soon
A: You've been the best bit of this ship.
B: Don't. I'll cry at breakfast.
A: Cry at lunch. Breakfast's busy.   #warm

? pair:mentor leaving:soon
A: Anything I should know, out there?
B: Ask. Listen. Write it down.
A: That's what you said on day one.
B: Still true.   #warm

? pair:mentor leaving:soon
A: Thank you. For all of it.
B: You did the work. I just watched.   #warm

? pair:couple leaving:soon
A: Two ships. That's all it is.
B: Two ships and a lot of letters.
A: I'll number them.   #warm

? pair:couple leaving:soon
A: I've packed your jumper by mistake.
B: Keep it. It's a good mistake.   #warm

? pair:any+any who:teague-theo with:hart-ravi leaving:soon
A: One last comic. You're the duck.
B: I'm always the duck.
A: You're a very good duck.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:moreau-signe with:achterberg-lars leaving:soon
A: Send me the last pages. All of them.
B: Every book? Even the good ones?
A: Especially those.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:santos-zofia with:tran-chloe leaving:soon
A: Who'll read the gossip with you?
B: Nobody reads it like you do.
A: Write me the best bits. Daily.   #warm

? pair:any+any who:keane-davi with:kovac-zainab|cruz-tove leaving:soon
A: Last climb up the ladder.
B: For the exercise.
A: Yes. For the exercise.   #warm

? pair:any+any who:alvarez-luca with:kim-yusuf|mbeki-bo leaving:soon
A: Gerald's coming with me.
B: Does Gerald want to go?
A: Gerald goes where I go.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:lindqvist-isak with:park-noor|larsen-hamid|haddad-tamsin leaving:soon
A: You keep the guitar book.
B: You haven't finished it.
A: I'll never finish it. You might.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:ueda-vera with:varga-tariq leaving:soon
A: Six weeks for a letter from Valo.
B: Seven, from where you're going.
A: Then start writing now.   #warm

? pair:any+any who:zamora-quinn with:mbeki-bo|rossi-femi leaving:soon time:night place:observatory
A: Last night up here.
B: The stars won't move.
A: No. I will. Look up for me.   #warm
